Source: hyphen-indic
Section: localization
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Debian-IN Team <debian-in-workers@alioth-lists.debian.net>
Uploaders: Balasankar C <balasankarc@debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12),
               dh-buildinfo,
               dictionaries-common (>= 0.10)
Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/debian-in-team/hyphen-indic.git
Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/debian-in-team/hyphen-indic
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://wiki.smc.org.in/Hyphenation
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hyphen-as
Architecture: all
Depends: dictionaries-common (>= 0.10), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Assamese hyphenation patterns for LibreOffice
 Hyphenation patterns hyphenate words at line boundary making it more
 natural to read.
 .
 This package contains hyphenation patterns for the Assamese
 script.

